  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "Grease a 12-cup muffin tin with vegetable oil.",
    "Cut the sausages in half lengthwise.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the flour, eggs, and milk to make the Yorkshire pudding batter.",
    "Pour the batter into the prepared muffin tin, filling each cup about 1/2 full.",
    "Place a sausage half in each muffin cup.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes, or until the Yorkshire puddings are golden brown and puffed up.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
